# Local review / working notes — not part of the system definition.
# These are generated analyses meant to be read, acted on, then deleted;
# tracking them would mean the repo carries a stale snapshot of machine
# state (disk usage, store size, package versions) that silently rots.
OPTIMIZATIONS.md
hosts/*/OPTIMIZATIONS.md

# Claude Code local state: permission allowlists, MCP servers, session data.
# Machine-local and can carry paths and history, so it stays out of a public
# repo. Note this deliberately does NOT match modules/desktop/claude-code.nix,
# which is system configuration and belongs in the repo.
.claude/
.claude.json
.mcp.json
CLAUDE.local.md
